{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/1430908-qq-about-the-runecaster-and-inscribe-runes","id":1430908,"title":"QQ about the Runecaster and Inscribe Runes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scarred Lands"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-03T13:03:21-08:00","id":1430908,"title":"QQ about the Runecaster and Inscribe Runes","content":"Love all the wonderful additions and options from the Player's Guide! I am not entirely certain how this bit works, regarding the Inscribed Runes number, quoting from pages 90 and 91:<br /> <br /> pg 90: &quot;Once inscribed with a spell, the rune remains in place, but inert, until the rune is triggered or dispelled.&quot;<br /> pg 91: &quot;Inscribed Runes.The Rune Caster table shows the number of times you can inscribe a spell as a rune. At 1st level, you can use this feature twice. You regain all expended uses of it when you finish a long rest.&quot;<br /> <br /> So, for example, can a Rune Caster inscribe the Multiply Missile spell twice on Day 1, then twice more on Day 2 and then on Day 3, expend all four Inscribed Runes?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26627-knyghtefall","name":"KnyghteFall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26627_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-07T06:30:49-08:00","id":1431390,"title":"","content":"That's how I understand it as RAW. I would probably impose a limit if I were to have a Runecaster at my table (just to avoid ppl stockpiling fireball grenades)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Alain%20Giorla\" target=\"_blank\">Slarecian Vault contributions</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5793-haaz","name":"haaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-12T07:01:10-08:00","id":1431966,"title":"","content":"What would you base the limit on? From what I can tell, this is a variation of the Glyph of Warding (with some critical caveats, agreed). To be sure, I think a limit would be a good thing, just don't want it to be too restrictive.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26627,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26627-knyghtefall","user":"KnyghteFall","date":". 01-12-2021, 10:05 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26627-knyghtefall","name":"KnyghteFall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26627_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-12T10:10:43-08:00","id":1431981,"title":"","content":"Not sure. I would say that the proficiency bonus would be a good start, but then it might be too restrictive. Maybe proficiency bonus + spellcasting ability modifier ? Or half the character level ?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>My <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Alain%20Giorla\" target=\"_blank\">Slarecian Vault contributions</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5793-haaz","name":"haaz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5793_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"66"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-12T12:39:57-08:00","id":1431993,"title":"","content":"Proficiency bonus + spellcasting ability modifier makes sense. If you became a Rune Caster at the minimum level (7th) and maxed at 12th, that would likely give you a total of 9 at 12th level. If it were half your level, that would barely cover your Inscribed Runes for the day. Still, rocking nine additional 5th level spells is pretty sweet!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26627,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26627-knyghtefall","user":"KnyghteFall","date":". 01-12-2021, 03:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26627-knyghtefall","name":"KnyghteFall","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26627_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-25T19:10:44-08:00","id":1433449,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>haaz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/scarred-lands/1430908-qq-about-the-runecaster-and-inscribe-runes?p=1431981#post1431981\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not sure. I would say that the proficiency bonus would be a good start, but then it might be too restrictive. Maybe proficiency bonus + spellcasting ability modifier ? Or half the character level ?</div> </div> </div> </div>This seems totally fair to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/They<br /> Moderator<br /> Line Developer: <b><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4261/Onyx-Path-Publishing/subcategory/8329_24824/Scarred-Lands-new\" target=\"_blank\">Scarred Lands</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25411-travislegge","name":"TravisLegge","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25411_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}